%% aoneahsan-cccs-react-state-zustand — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Some state needs a home]) --> origin{Where does the<br/>data come from?}

    origin -->|a server| query[TanStack Query owns it.<br/>Putting it in zustand means<br/>rebuilding caching + invalidation<br/>+ refetching by hand]
    origin -->|the client| readers{How many components<br/>read it?}

    readers -->|exactly one| localstate[useState. A store for state<br/>nobody else reads is overhead]
    readers -->|several, or it must<br/>outlive the component| store[zustand store]

    store --> which{Does a store for this<br/>domain already exist?}
    which -->|yes| addslice[Add to it]
    which -->|no| newstore[Create one PER DOMAIN —<br/>authStore, cartStore, themeStore.<br/>Not one global store]

    addslice --> actions
    newstore --> actions
    actions[Actions live IN the store beside<br/>the state they mutate]
    actions --> derived{Is this value computable<br/>from other state?}
    derived -->|yes| compute[Compute it. A stored derived value<br/>is a second source of truth<br/>that WILL disagree]
    derived -->|no| persist

    compute --> persist
    persist{Should it survive a reload?}
    persist -->|no| consume
    persist -->|yes| middleware[persist middleware +<br/>a storage adapter — strata-storage,<br/>NEVER raw localStorage]
    middleware --> hydrate[Gate first paint on rehydration<br/>so the app never flashes<br/>the wrong theme]
    hydrate --> authed{User signed in?}
    authed -->|yes| sync[Second layer: same prefs in the<br/>backend. Remote wins on sign-in,<br/>debounce writes]
    authed -->|no| consume
    sync --> consume

    consume[Consuming in a component]
    consume --> selector{How are you reading it?}
    selector -->|"destructuring<br/>useStore()"| wrong[WRONG — re-renders on EVERY<br/>store change. The usual reason<br/>zustand feels slow]
    selector -->|"selector<br/>useStore(s => s.items)"| right[Correct. Multiple values:<br/>useShallow or separate selectors]
    wrong --> right

    query --> done
    localstate --> done
    right --> done
    done([Verify: no unexpected re-renders])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class origin,readers,which,derived,persist,authed,selector gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
    class wrong warn
